; `mul' is the low half of a 16x16 product from a hardware multiplier - the
; iCE40 UP5K's DSP.  A part without one has no `mul', so it is off unless
; asked for, and libgcc, built without it, runs on either.
mmul
Target Mask(MUL)
Use the mul instruction, which needs a hardware multiplier.
